        // SAFETY: `lmc_view.sublen` is the backing storage for cached sublen data;
        // this function computes the per-`pos` row base exactly as the original code did.
        // The row length is the compile-time constant `ZOPFLI_CACHE_LENGTH * 3`, and callers
